==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~43.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A tedious stage, but not difficult. Chip away at Metal Hippoe with cheap meatshield swarms, and kill the otters with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].

